  "title": "Button Tag vs Input Type=\"button\" Attribute - GeeksforGeeks",
  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>The &lt;input type=\"button\"&gt; and &lt;button&gt; tags both create buttons in HTML, but &lt;button&gt; provides greater flexibility by allowing nested content like text, images, or HTML elements, whereas &lt;input&gt; is limited to a single value.</span></p><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>&lt;button&gt; can include text, images, or HTML elements inside it.</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>&lt;button&gt; supports type attributes like submit, reset, or button.</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>&lt;input type=\"button\"&gt; only displays a single label via the value attribute.</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>Buttons using &lt;button&gt; can be styled and structured more flexibly than &lt;input&gt;.</span></li><li value=\"5\"><span>&lt;button&gt; allows richer interactivity and layout customization within the element.</span></li></ul><blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Note:</strong></b><span> The &lt;button&gt; tag uses opening and closing bracket but &lt;input type=\"button\"&gt; attribute uses only single tag.   </span></p></blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Example 1:</strong></b><span> This example uses &lt;input type=\"button\"&gt; attribute to create button in HTML document. </span></p><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">script</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"nx\">alert</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"values submitted\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">script</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">head</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span> <span class=\"na\">style </span><span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s\">\"text-align:center;\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h1</span> <span class=\"na\">style </span><span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s\">\"color:green;\"</span> <span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>  GeeksForGeeks <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h1</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Using Input type<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">form</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">label</span> <span class=\"na\">for</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"submit\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n            Enter value\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">label</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">input</span> <span class=\"na\">type </span><span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s\">\"text\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">input</span> <span class=\"na\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"button\"</span> <span class=\"na\">id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"submit\"</span> \n            <span class=\"na\">onclick </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"msg()\"</span> <span class=\"na\">value</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"button\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">form</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        here the input type button\n        works properly\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">p</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>                    \n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Example 2:</strong></b><span> This example uses &lt;button&gt; tag to create button in HTML document. </span></p><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">html</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"html\" data-main-code-start=\"6\" data-main-code-end=\"21\">\n    <code class=\"language-html\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span class=\"driver-code\"><span></span><span class=\"cm\">&lt;!--Driver Code Starts--&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span> <span class=\"na\">style </span><span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s\">\"text-align:center;\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h1</span> <span class=\"na\">style </span><span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s\">\"color:green;\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> GeeksForGeeks <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h1</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span> \n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>The Button Element<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">h2</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">&lt;!--Driver Code Ends--&gt;</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"main-code\">    <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">form</span> <span class=\"na\">method</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"post\"</span> <span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">label</span> <span class=\"na\">for</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"uname\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">b</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Username<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">b</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">label</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">input</span> <span class=\"na\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"text\"</span> <span class=\"na\">placeholder</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"Enter Username\"</span> \n                <span class=\"na\">name</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"uname\"</span> <span class=\"na\">required</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">br</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">label</span> <span class=\"na\">for</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"psw\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">b</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Password<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">b</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">label</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">input</span> <span class=\"na\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"password\"</span> <span class=\"na\">placeholder</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"Enter Password\"</span>\n                <span class=\"na\">name</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"psw\"</span> <span class=\"na\">required</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">br</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span> <span class=\"na\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"submit\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">img</span> <span class=\"na\">src</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>\n        <span class=\"s\">\"https://www.freeiconspng.com/uploads/login-button-png-4.jpg\"</span>\n            <span class=\"na\">height</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"40\"</span> <span class=\"na\">width</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"100\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">br</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span> <span class=\"na\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"button\"</span> <span class=\"na\">class</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"cancelbtn\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Cancel<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">button</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">span</span> <span class=\"na\">class</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"psw\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>Forgot <span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nt\">a</span> <span class=\"na\">href</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s\">\"#\"</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>password?<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">a</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">span</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">form</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"driver-code\"><span class=\"cm\">&lt;!--Driver Code Starts--&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">body</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"nt\">html</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;</span>                    \n\n<span class=\"cm\">&lt;!--Driver Code Ends--&gt;</span>\n</span></pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs></div>",
  "textContent": "The <input type=\"button\"> and <button> tags both create buttons in HTML, but <button> provides greater flexibility by allowing nested content like text, images, or HTML elements, whereas <input> is limited to a single value.<button> can include text, images, or HTML elements inside it.<button> supports type attributes like submit, reset, or button.<input type=\"button\"> only displays a single label via the value attribute.Buttons using <button> can be styled and structured more flexibly than <input>.<button> allows richer interactivity and layout customization within the element.Note: The <button> tag uses opening and closing bracket but <input type=\"button\"> attribute uses only single tag.   Example 1: This example uses <input type=\"button\"> attribute to create button in HTML document. \n            html\n\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <script>\n        function msg() {\n            alert(\"values submitted\");\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body style = \"text-align:center;\"> \n    <h1 style = \"color:green;\" >  GeeksForGeeks </h1> \n    <h2>Using Input type</h2> \n    <form>\n        <label for=\"submit\">\n            Enter value\n        </label>\n        <input type = \"text\">\n        <input type=\"button\" id=\"submit\" \n            onclick =\"msg()\" value=\"button\"> \n    </form> \n    <p>\n        here the input type button\n        works properly\n    </p>\n</body>\n</html>                    \n\nExample 2: This example uses <button> tag to create button in HTML document. \n            html\n\n    <!--Driver Code Starts-->\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body style = \"text-align:center;\"> \n    <h1 style = \"color:green;\"> GeeksForGeeks </h1> \n    <h2>The Button Element</h2>\n<!--Driver Code Ends-->\n\n    <form method=\"post\" >\n        <label for=\"uname\"><b>Username</b></label>\n        <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter Username\" \n                name=\"uname\" required>\n        <br>\n        <label for=\"psw\"><b>Password</b></label>\n        <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"Enter Password\"\n                name=\"psw\" required>\n        <br>\n        <button type=\"submit\"><img src=\n        \"https://www.freeiconspng.com/uploads/login-button-png-4.jpg\"\n            height=\"40\" width=\"100\">\n        </button><br>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"cancelbtn\">Cancel</button>\n        <span class=\"psw\">Forgot <a href=\"#\">password?</a></span>\n    </form>\n\n<!--Driver Code Starts-->\n</body>\n</html>                    \n\n<!--Driver Code Ends-->",
  "url": "https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/html/button-tag-vs-input-typebutton-attribute"
}
